{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_047BC5EC","title":"Sanna at the Space Port","entry":"Dlg_047BC5EC::entry","exit":"Dlg_047BC5EC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_3B470428","articyId":"72057645577612691","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Hey! This place is something else, huh? Are you just watching the rockets taking off, or jumping on one?","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey! This place is something else, huh? Are you just watching the rockets taking off, or jumping on one?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":575.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38212","byteOffset":28791680,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_6DB26419","articyId":"72057645577612705","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Yeah, we can't leave anyway. Not unless you can afford the MASSIVE bribe you'd need to pay to escape the LUZ.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah, we can't leave anyway. Not unless you can afford the MASSIVE bribe you'd need to pay to escape the LUZ.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1175.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17386","byteOffset":14465960,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_8FB5A37B","articyId":"72057645577612719","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I guess I'm like someone trapped under the ice, and I'm attracted to the light from the sun, so I'm looking up at it. Through the ice.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I guess I'm like someone trapped under the ice, and I'm attracted to the light from the sun, so I'm looking up at it. Through the ice.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33080","byteOffset":20397848,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_5C1987FD","articyId":"72057645577612746","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I'm fine. Fine! I mean, I'm still here. For better or worse.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm fine. Fine! I mean, I'm still here. For better or worse.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42421","byteOffset":30376008,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_F7E97F67","articyId":"72057645577612752","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Nah, it's not THAT bad. I mean this morning I accidently asked a barista for a \"depresso\". But I'm managing.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah, it's not THAT bad. I mean this morning I accidently asked a barista for a \"depresso\". But I'm managing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33876","byteOffset":20698344,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_36D1429B","articyId":"72057645577612757","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"No! Didn't think of that. Good idea.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No! Didn't think of that. Good idea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51241","byteOffset":33798296,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_92477058","articyId":"72057645577612777","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"...I think so. The lower gravity will help with the pain in my knees and spine. And there's spelunking on Luna too. I think I could make a new start there. I even have a job offer - a good one.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...I think so. The lower gravity will help with the pain in my knees and spine. And there's spelunking on Luna too. I think I could make a new start there. I even have a job offer - a good one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48754","byteOffset":32782144,"byteLength":540}},{"id":"DFr_93FB5C02","articyId":"72057645577612798","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Sounds like a fresh start. But... I'm not sure if I should tell you this... You're gonna give me a hard time.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds like a fresh start. But... I'm not sure if I should tell you this... You're gonna give me a hard time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3575.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29551","byteOffset":19058712,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_71E8C22A","articyId":"72057645577612813","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Ok... so... My Ex called me and we talked. We talked for hours. It was... really nice actually. Like old times.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok... so... My Ex called me and we talked. We talked for hours. It was... really nice actually. Like old times.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4175.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39162","byteOffset":29147640,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_6B4C4615","articyId":"72057645577612834","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I really was starting to find my feet on my own, you know. It took me a while. And she... wants me to move in with her to help look after her mom.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I really was starting to find my feet on my own, you know. It took me a while. And she... wants me to move in with her to help look after her mom.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5375.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42526","byteOffset":30415352,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_EF694425","articyId":"72057645577612853","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"She... wants to have the opposite of a trial separation. We could have a trial... what would you call it? We could try getting back together.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She... wants to have the opposite of a trial separation. We could have a trial... what would you call it? We could try getting back together.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4775.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18673","byteOffset":14950768,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_21943F0A","articyId":"72057645577612907","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I don't know. She needs money. I could protect her. I could keep my job here. Pass up on the Luna job. I dunno...","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know. She needs money. I could protect her. I could keep my job here. Pass up on the Luna job. I dunno...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5975.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43918","byteOffset":30949312,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_75C56855","articyId":"72057645577612936","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Yeah... it's just... I don't know. Was I really in love with her? I mean I think I was, but also... maybe I was scared of being alone. But then being alone... it's not THAT bad.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah... it's just... I don't know. Was I really in love with her? I mean I think I was, but also... maybe I was scared of being alone. But then being alone... it's not THAT bad.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":6575.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23288","byteOffset":16692056,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_D9848ABD","articyId":"72057645577612943","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Yeah. And I miss her, but... maybe I was scared of being alone. And then when I was alone... I kind of found my feet. It wasn't so bad.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. And I miss her, but... maybe I was scared of being alone. And then when I was alone... I kind of found my feet. It wasn't so bad.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":6575.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26562","byteOffset":17929152,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_50B39A08","articyId":"72057645577612967","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I need to think about this. I feel like I'm standing on the edge of a big, dark pit and someone I love is telling me it's fine to step forward.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need to think about this. I feel like I'm standing on the edge of a big, dark pit and someone I love is telling me it's fine to step forward.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":7175.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28866","byteOffset":18804208,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_AC876849","articyId":"72057645577612991","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"All I wanted was to get her back, but now she's there in front of me, I don't feel happy. I feel like I'm in danger... Fuck it. I need to get some sleep and clear my head. I'll make a decision tomorrow. See you later.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"All I wanted was to get her back, but now she's there in front of me, I don't feel happy. I feel like I'm in danger... Fuck it. I need to get some sleep and clear my head. I'll make a decision tomorrow. See you later.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7775.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50551","byteOffset":33465128,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_F15A6A32","articyId":"72057645577612698","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Just watching.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just watching.","TextSheVersion":"Just watching.","TextTheyVersion":"Just watching."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":875.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32271","byteOffset":20088200,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_6454862A","articyId":"72057645577612712","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What are you doing here?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What are you doing here?","TextSheVersion":"What are you doing here?","TextTheyVersion":"What are you doing here?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26464","byteOffset":17893080,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_D655CB42","articyId":"72057645577612726","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Still that bad huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Still that bad huh?","TextSheVersion":"Still that bad huh?","TextTheyVersion":"Still that bad huh?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38484","byteOffset":28893472,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_9B0A25EA","articyId":"72057645577612731","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Have you tried cheering up?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have you tried cheering up?","TextSheVersion":"Have you tried cheering up?","TextTheyVersion":"Have you tried cheering up?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17240","byteOffset":14411536,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_C2C69A1F","articyId":"72057645577612740","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're gonna get through this Sanna. Stay strong.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're gonna get through this Sanna. Stay strong.","TextSheVersion":"You're gonna get through this Sanna. Stay strong.","TextTheyVersion":"You're gonna get through this Sanna. Stay strong."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39150","byteOffset":29143032,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_BAA6F470","articyId":"72057645577612768","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"When you're allowed to leave, will you get on a shuttle?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"When you're allowed to leave, will you get on a shuttle?","TextSheVersion":"When you're allowed to leave, will you get on a shuttle?","TextTheyVersion":"When you're allowed to leave, will you get on a shuttle?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2675.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37414","byteOffset":28493128,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_DCD3E795","articyId":"72057645577612784","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds exciting.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds exciting.","TextSheVersion":"Sounds exciting.","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds exciting."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49631","byteOffset":33118352,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_0D5E4296","articyId":"72057645577612790","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds dangerous.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds dangerous.","TextSheVersion":"Sounds dangerous.","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds dangerous."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3275.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47501","byteOffset":32306800,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_0A351303","articyId":"72057645577612806","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?","TextSheVersion":"What?","TextTheyVersion":"What?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22371","byteOffset":16348864,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_019CE796","articyId":"72057645577612820","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Is that what you want?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is that what you want?","TextSheVersion":"Is that what you want?","TextTheyVersion":"Is that what you want?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5075.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25633","byteOffset":17581488,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_3827C76B","articyId":"72057645577612825","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Be careful","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Be careful","TextSheVersion":"Be careful","TextTheyVersion":"Be careful"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5075.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43020","byteOffset":30605560,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_0A03CD68","articyId":"72057645577612846","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And?","TextSheVersion":"And?","TextTheyVersion":"And?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4475.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44562","byteOffset":31188824,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_7B49F40E","articyId":"72057645577612893","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You should help her.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You should help her.","TextSheVersion":"You should help her.","TextTheyVersion":"You should help her."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5675.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26676","byteOffset":17971016,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_4A1D7A21","articyId":"72057645577612898","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Could she be using you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could she be using you?","TextSheVersion":"Could she be using you?","TextTheyVersion":"Could she be using you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5675.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18886","byteOffset":15032120,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_36313C68","articyId":"72057645577612915","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I thought you hated your job here.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought you hated your job here.","TextSheVersion":"I thought you hated your job here.","TextTheyVersion":"I thought you hated your job here."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6275.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36421","byteOffset":28123536,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_38362A2C","articyId":"72057645577612920","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"But you were really excited about the Luna opportunity.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But you were really excited about the Luna opportunity.","TextSheVersion":"But you were really excited about the Luna opportunity.","TextTheyVersion":"But you were really excited about the Luna opportunity."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6275.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29804","byteOffset":19156416,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_CB5C5BC3","articyId":"72057645577612925","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"If you really love her you should go back to her.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you really love her you should go back to her.","TextSheVersion":"If you really love her you should go back to her.","TextTheyVersion":"If you really love her you should go back to her."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6275.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27401","byteOffset":18247360,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_97D4ECAD","articyId":"72057645577612951","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Being alone is better than being in a bad relationship.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Being alone is better than being in a bad relationship.","TextSheVersion":"Being alone is better than being in a bad relationship.","TextTheyVersion":"Being alone is better than being in a bad relationship."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":6900.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23702","byteOffset":16847448,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_4A14476A","articyId":"72057645577612958","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Relationships take work.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localizatio